  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_NoApps\Text:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: • ሁሉንም መተግበሪያዎች እና ፕሮግራሞች ያስወግዱ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line3_Featured\Text:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: • የግል ፋይሎችን ያቆዩ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line2\Text:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: • የክንውን አውዶችን ውደ ነባሪነታቸው ይመልሱ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line1\Text:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: • ሁሉንም ከየግል ኮምፒዩተሩ ጋር ያልመጡ መተግበሪያዎች እና ፕሮግራሞች ያስወግዱ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line0\Text:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: ዳግ ማስጀመር፦
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_MeteredDataWarning_Format:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: • የክላውድ ማውረድ ከ%ws ውሂብ በላይ ሊሆን ይችላል። ግንኙነትዎ የተለካ ነው እና ክፍያዎች ሊተገበሩ ይችላሉ።
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_Header:
